ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">复印；复制；抄写；书封宣传语；书皮简介文字；广告语；广告标语</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223219\">このページをコピーして<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请抄本页。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">コピーする</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">复印；复制；抄写；书封宣传语；书皮简介文字；广告语；广告标语</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219109\">コピーするページに<ruby>付箋<rp>(</rp><rt>ふせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつけておいてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">在您想要复制的页面上贴个标签 。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">個別</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こべつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">个别；各自；独立；逐一</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230027\">あらゆる<ruby>事態<rp>(</rp><rt>じたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>個別<rp>(</rp><rt>こべつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>分析<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>必要<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每一种情况都需要个别分析。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">こぼす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">溅出；洒出；滴落；流